Z||000014||Ken Wittlief||08-01-2001||10:43 AM||||Im pretty sure you can spin the wheels on just about any fiero.  Turn the steering wheel all the way to one side and floor it in first gear - the car will lean off the driving wheel and it will spin - I havent done this with my V6/auto, but I have pulled out of side streets on a turn from a start and had the wheel start to brake loose - Im sure if the steering wheel was hard over it would squeel pretty good.||||reg||1
